### RSSI puller log shape (LAW 50: verify columns before reading)
tail -2 /var/lib/aria-fleet/rssi/192.168.2.105.log
head -1 /var/lib/aria-fleet/rssi/192.168.2.105.log
### ext2 (.105) uptime today: did the camera reboot? (uptime resets)
awk "{print \$1, \$NF}" /var/lib/aria-fleet/rssi/192.168.2.105.log | tail -30
### ext3 (.103) uptime today
awk "{print \$1, \$NF}" /var/lib/aria-fleet/rssi/192.168.2.103.log | tail -30